{
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "workspace": {
    "type": "core://Page",
    "id": "agent_report",
    "title": "Agent report",
    "root": {
      "type": "core://Box",
      "fill": true,
      "background": "${local://theme#page}",
      "content": {
        "type": "core://Scroll",
        "content": {
          "type": "core://Column",
          "spacing_dp": 12,
          "padding_h_dp": 16,
          "padding_v_dp": 16,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "core://Text",
              "style": "Title",
              "value_expr": "Agent runs",
              "weight": "SemiBold"
            },
            {
              "type": "core://List",
              "query_key": "agents:sessions",
              "spacing_dp": 8,
              "item_template": {
                "type": "core://Box",
                "background": "${local://theme#card}",
                "border_color": "${local://theme#card_border}",
                "corner_dp": 14,
                "padding_h_dp": 16,
                "padding_v_dp": 12,
                "content": {
                  "type": "core://Column",
                  "spacing_dp": 2,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "core://Text",
                      "style": "Label",
                      "value_expr": "$item.title"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "core://Box",
                      "content_color": "${local://theme#muted_text}",
                      "content": {
                        "type": "core://Text",
                        "style": "Secondary",
                        "value_expr": "$item.summary",
                        "markdown": true,
                        "max_lines": 2
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "core://Box",
              "background": "${local://theme#highlight}",
              "border_color": "${local://theme#card_border}",
              "corner_dp": 14,
              "padding_h_dp": 16,
              "padding_v_dp": 12,
              "content": {
                "type": "core://Text",
                "style": "Body",
                "markdown": true,
                "value_expr": "${agents://sessions/r1#needs_you_text}"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "core://Box",
              "background": "${local://theme#card}",
              "border_color": "${local://theme#card_border}",
              "corner_dp": 14,
              "padding_h_dp": 16,
              "padding_v_dp": 12,
              "content": {
                "type": "core://Text",
                "style": "Body",
                "markdown": true,
                "value_expr": "${agents://sessions/r1#summary}"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "entities": {
    "agents://sessions/r1": {
      "title": "Fix the login redirect",
      "summary": "## Summary\n\nFixed the **login redirect** loop: `auth::callback` now keeps the `next` parameter, so signing in lands you where you started. See [the PR](https://github.example/acme/app/pull/42).\n\n### What changed\n\n- `crates/auth/src/callback.rs`: keep *only* same-site `next` values\n- Added 3 tests for the redirect\n  - open redirects are refused\n  - ~~old~~ legacy paths still work\n- [x] CI green\n- [ ] Deploy to staging\n\n1. Merge the PR\n2. Watch the deploy\n\n> Heads up: sessions signed in before the fix still have the old cookie.\n\n```rust\nif !next.starts_with('/') {\n    return Redirect::to(\"/\");\n}\n```\n\n| Check | Result |\n|---|---|\n| Unit tests | 128 passed |\n| Clippy | clean |\n\n---\nNext I'd look at the *sign-out* flow.",
      "needs_you_text": "Should I **merge** now, or wait for review on `#42`?"
    },
    "agents://sessions/r2": {
      "title": "Tidy the settings page",
      "summary": "## Done\n\nMoved **Theme** under *Appearance* and renamed `dark_mode` to `theme`; all tests pass and the screenshots are attached to the PR."
    }
  },
  "queries": {
    "agents:sessions": [
      "agents://sessions/r1",
      "agents://sessions/r2"
    ]
  }
}
